<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index fell 1.80 to 644.35.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.15.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 323 to 225.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,370,080 compared with 27,357,660 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
